# Keyboard codes are a bit odd on RO.
#  1-26: Ctrl-A to Ctrl-Z
#  8:    Backspace
#  13:   Return
#  27:   Escape
#  30:   Home
#  127:  Delete
#
# Codes >= 0x100 are translated into:
#  27, (code AND &FF)
#
